WEBVTT

01:33.360 --> 01:36.240
<b>Episode 11
"Piano"</b>

01:35.060 --> 01:36.240
<b>You surprised me.</b>

01:36.760 --> 01:37.760
<b>I'm happy,</b>

01:38.470 --> 01:39.490
<b>but...</b>

01:42.070 --> 01:45.870
<b>Kakeru-kun, I wonder if you really like me.</b>

01:49.890 --> 01:50.890
<b>I—</b>

01:51.510 --> 01:52.440
<b>Am I</b>

01:53.300 --> 01:56.300
<b>just trying to make myself think I like you?</b>

01:57.160 --> 01:58.050
<b>Are you?</b>

01:58.980 --> 02:02.340
<b>Am I just trying to validate myself?</b>

02:03.140 --> 02:06.820
<b>It's still snowing around me.</b>

02:06.820 --> 02:09.430
<b>But you can't see it.</b>

02:10.150 --> 02:12.770
<b>We don't understand anything 
about each other.</b>

02:13.830 --> 02:14.790
<b>Yeah,</b>

02:15.360 --> 02:17.110
<b>I don't see the snow.</b>

02:25.210 --> 02:28.340
<b>I'm hoping to get my mom 
to play piano for me.</b>

02:28.780 --> 02:30.090
<b>I want you to come, too.</b>

02:30.610 --> 02:32.060
<b>Your mom's piano?</b>

02:32.440 --> 02:33.440
<b>That's great.</b>

02:34.880 --> 02:37.950
<b>She's a professional. I think 
she'll take it seriously.</b>

02:38.300 --> 02:39.150
<b>Then—</b>

02:40.530 --> 02:42.090
<b>Then, what?</b>

02:43.370 --> 02:44.050
<b>I want you to come.</b>

02:44.810 --> 02:48.530
<b>Will we learn something about 
the two of us if we're there?</b>

02:49.600 --> 02:51.250
<b>I'll call Mom now.</b>

02:51.810 --> 02:53.020
<b>Let's ask her to do it tomorrow.</b>

02:54.690 --> 02:56.240
<b>Okikura speaking.</b>

02:56.240 --> 02:57.140
<i>Mom?</i>

02:57.140 --> 02:59.120
<b>Kakeru? What is it?</b>

02:59.420 --> 03:01.230
<i>I have a new friend.</i>

03:01.530 --> 03:04.160
<i>Could you play the piano for her?</i>

03:04.480 --> 03:06.360
<b>That's an unusual request.</b>

03:06.360 --> 03:08.790
<b>It's the first time you've 
ever said anything like that.</b>

03:08.790 --> 03:09.580
<i>Yeah.</i>

03:09.960 --> 03:11.070
<b>Sure.</b>

03:11.070 --> 03:13.640
<b>I might as well play a few pieces.</b>

03:13.950 --> 03:16.370
<b>Why don't you invite her parents, 
too, if they're available?</b>

03:16.670 --> 03:17.630
<i>Good idea.</i>

03:18.010 --> 03:19.100
<i>Thanks, Mom.</i>

03:20.030 --> 03:20.930
<b>Kakeru,</b>

03:22.060 --> 03:24.640
<b>so, about what we were talking about.</b>

03:25.170 --> 03:26.200
<i>What about it?</i>

03:26.640 --> 03:28.220
<b>Want to come with me?</b>

03:30.070 --> 03:31.010
<b>I'm thinking about it.</b>

03:31.830 --> 03:34.710
<i>Your friend that lent you this phone—</i>

03:34.710 --> 03:36.110
<i>Fukami-san, isn't it?</i>

03:37.110 --> 03:38.970
<i>I met her once.</i>

03:38.970 --> 03:41.730
<i>She came by when you 
happened not to be home.</i>

03:42.170 --> 03:43.200
<b>I see.</b>

03:43.580 --> 03:44.660
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:45.680 --> 03:47.620
<b>She's kind and indecisive.</b>

03:48.410 --> 03:51.710
<i>She gets pushed around. 
She has trouble with it.</i>

03:52.400 --> 03:54.750
<i>And I'm making her even more confused.</i>

03:55.170 --> 03:58.300
<i>She made me realize I don't know anything.</i>

03:59.200 --> 04:01.170
<b>I see. You like her.</b>

04:02.310 --> 04:02.850
<b>Yeah.</b>

04:07.830 --> 04:08.640
<b>Let's go home.</b>

04:10.860 --> 04:13.560
<b>I'll stay here a little longer.</b>

04:15.090 --> 04:19.020
<b>I feel like this summer started here.</b>

04:19.970 --> 04:21.430
<b>I want to stay here longer.</b>

04:21.430 --> 04:23.990
<b>This is my place, I think.</b>

04:25.380 --> 04:26.210
<b>Your place?</b>

04:26.510 --> 04:28.310
<b>Sacchan told me.</b>

04:29.010 --> 04:30.460
<b>The season,</b>

04:30.870 --> 04:32.800
<b>and the time, and the people you're with,</b>

04:32.800 --> 04:35.730
<b>make an ordinary place special.</b>

04:38.000 --> 04:40.460
<b>You should go home before it gets too late.</b>

04:40.460 --> 04:41.260
<b>Okay.</b>

04:41.910 --> 04:44.720
<b>See you tomorrow afternoon, at my place.</b>

04:45.790 --> 04:46.510
<b>Got it.</b>

05:01.930 --> 05:03.070
<b>Hina-chan?</b>

05:03.420 --> 05:04.930
<b>Yes, please.</b>

05:04.930 --> 05:07.190
<b>I'll be home by tomorrow morning.</b>

05:07.490 --> 05:10.490
<b>Make sure Mom and Dad don't 
get too worried. Thanks.</b>

05:10.720 --> 05:13.170
<b>Please. Okay, I'm hanging up.</b>

05:16.900 --> 05:18.880
<b>Onee-chan, oh no!</b>

05:36.120 --> 05:37.390
<b>I'm home.</b>

05:37.390 --> 05:39.590
<b>Welcome. You're late.</b>

05:40.670 --> 05:42.180
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:44.280 --> 05:46.490
<b>Welcome home, Onee-chan.</b>

05:50.240 --> 05:52.400
<b>I hope she's doing well.</b>

05:52.820 --> 05:54.450
<b>Dinner, you two.</b>

05:54.750 --> 05:55.800
<b>Coming.</b>

05:58.310 --> 06:00.580
<b>Onee-chan says she'll eat later.</b>

06:11.410 --> 06:12.430
<b>Thanks for the food.</b>

06:12.960 --> 06:15.890
<b>She says she's not too hungry today, 
so she only needs a little.</b>

06:16.340 --> 06:18.240
<b>That sister of mine's so selfish.</b>

06:18.540 --> 06:19.270
<b>Oh.</b>

06:23.560 --> 06:25.730
<b>I want to go to the mountains again.</b>

06:26.910 --> 06:30.560
<i>Yeah? Mountains are nice.</i>

06:30.920 --> 06:32.850
<i>I wonder if Nee-chan can make it this week.</i>

06:32.850 --> 06:35.330
<b>No, I want to hike from the bottom.</b>

06:41.890 --> 06:42.940
<b>How's your</b>

06:44.920 --> 06:45.670
<b>knee?</b>

06:47.140 --> 06:49.530
<b>The trainer who's been helping me out</b>

06:49.530 --> 06:51.710
<b>says it's a lot better now.</b>

06:52.200 --> 06:52.910
<b>Oh.</b>

06:53.710 --> 06:55.190
<b>I'm glad I went to training camp.</b>

06:55.960 --> 06:58.370
<b>Are you joining the club 
again second semester?</b>

06:59.100 --> 07:01.570
<b>Coach says I should.</b>

07:02.180 --> 07:03.330
<b>I think I will.</b>

07:04.980 --> 07:05.770
<b>Maybe</b>

07:06.290 --> 07:09.670
<b>I don't really know what Yanagi's doing.</b>

07:11.140 --> 07:12.820
<b>Want to come watch my lessons?</b>

07:38.600 --> 07:40.310
<b>You didn't go home?</b>

07:40.630 --> 07:42.370
<b>That's my line.</b>

07:42.730 --> 07:44.880
<b>You were supposed to go home after a while.</b>

08:16.490 --> 08:17.760
<b>I wonder if this'll become</b>

08:18.320 --> 08:20.150
<b>my place if I stay here all night.</b>

08:21.180 --> 08:22.300
<b>Well—</b>

08:22.630 --> 08:24.380
<b>If I had my own place...</b>

08:25.510 --> 08:28.980
<b>Will you not have to be with your 
"sudden, expected loneliness"?</b>

08:32.550 --> 08:34.240
<b>Is it still snowing?</b>

08:34.670 --> 08:37.250
<b>No, not anymore.</b>

09:25.820 --> 09:27.750
<b>Morning, Kakeru.</b>

09:28.800 --> 09:30.020
<b>That call—</b>

09:31.800 --> 09:33.240
<b>Is he sleeping out again?</b>

09:37.940 --> 09:38.680
<b>Morning.</b>

09:40.730 --> 09:43.070
<b>Can Fukami-san's parents make it?</b>

09:43.600 --> 09:44.390
<b>Probably.</b>

09:44.680 --> 09:48.390
<b>Let's have them come a bit early 
and have a light meal with us.</b>

09:48.910 --> 09:49.740
<b>Sure.</b>

09:55.500 --> 09:57.810
<i>You're going to have a real
talk with Touko, aren't you?</i>

09:58.500 --> 09:59.130
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:59.430 --> 10:01.130
<i>You still can't decide?</i>

10:01.430 --> 10:04.570
<i>Just because you have Touko doesn't 
mean you can't escape from <i>that</i>.</i>

10:04.570 --> 10:05.450
<b>Yeah,</b>

10:05.870 --> 10:06.870
<b>I know.</b>

10:37.000 --> 10:38.510
<b>What?</b>

10:38.830 --> 10:41.960
<b>You sure have guts when it really 
comes down to it, Onee-chan.</b>

10:41.960 --> 10:43.660
<b>What?</b>

10:43.660 --> 10:45.850
<b>That was the highest compliment of the</b>

10:45.850 --> 10:48.470
<b>Hinode-hama Middle School Girls' Swim Club.</b>

10:49.520 --> 10:50.350
<b>I see.</b>

10:53.240 --> 10:54.920
<b>I don't have to carry it?</b>

10:55.310 --> 10:58.790
<b>This isn't a service. 
It's just to be safe.</b>

10:59.090 --> 11:01.130
<b>You don't trust me?</b>

11:01.450 --> 11:03.180
<b>Honestly, I'm worried,</b>

11:03.180 --> 11:04.700
<b>but I'm not going to let you force yourself.</b>

11:05.880 --> 11:06.510
<b>What?</b>

11:07.840 --> 11:08.980
<b>I'm here for you.</b>

11:11.090 --> 11:11.980
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:33.280 --> 11:34.860
<b>Morning.</b>

11:35.610 --> 11:36.710
<b>Morning.</b>

11:37.040 --> 11:37.710
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:37.710 --> 11:38.700
<b>Morning.</b>

11:38.700 --> 11:40.950
<b>I don't want breakfast.</b>

11:40.950 --> 11:43.260
<b>That's pretty unusual, Hina.</b>

11:43.780 --> 11:46.880
<b>Stuff happened yesterday.
I ate too much.</b>

11:46.880 --> 11:48.380
<b>"Stuff"? What?</b>

11:48.660 --> 11:50.180
<b>I'll have lots.</b>

11:50.560 --> 11:52.020
<b>I'm so hungry.</b>

11:52.020 --> 11:53.770
<b>It looks so good!</b>

11:54.070 --> 11:57.650
<b>Mom, Hina-chan says she's not 
hungry, so I'll have hers.</b>

12:12.710 --> 12:14.360
<b>Use that root.</b>

12:23.680 --> 12:27.300
<b>Hinode Dance School</b>

12:38.350 --> 12:40.860
<b>Sounds good. I'd love to be there.</b>

12:41.180 --> 12:42.560
<b>What about you, Mom?</b>

12:42.560 --> 12:43.490
<b>Definitely.</b>

12:43.490 --> 12:44.750
<b>So we're set.</b>

12:44.750 --> 12:46.920
<b>All right! I'm going to wear that outfit.</b>

12:48.280 --> 12:51.110
<b>I'll start early on work, then.</b>

12:51.110 --> 12:52.750
<b>I'll help.</b>

14:02.760 --> 14:03.990
<b>What's that about?</b>

14:03.990 --> 14:05.920
<b>Everyone's all like, "Who's that?"</b>

14:05.920 --> 14:08.030
<b>"What is he to you?"</b>

14:09.680 --> 14:10.360
<b>Oh.</b>

14:11.730 --> 14:13.730
<b>So, what'd you think?</b>

14:14.760 --> 14:15.640
<b>What'd I think?</b>

14:15.640 --> 14:17.210
<b>Yeah, your thoughts.</b>

14:19.270 --> 14:22.710
<b>You danced the best out of everyone 
there, and you were the prettiest.</b>

14:27.860 --> 14:28.890
<b>You're</b>

14:29.360 --> 14:31.620
<b>leaving after you graduate, aren't you?</b>

14:38.560 --> 14:39.430
<b>Hey,</b>

14:40.910 --> 14:43.070
<b>I did my best yesterday.</b>

14:46.000 --> 14:48.670
<b>Are you going to 
Hinode-hama High School</b>

14:48.670 --> 14:50.150
<b>with Onee-chan starting next semester?</b>

14:51.380 --> 14:52.630
<b>That's my plan.</b>

14:52.910 --> 14:56.040
<b>I haven't officially transferred yet.</b>

14:56.040 --> 14:57.290
<b>What are you two talking about?</b>

14:58.450 --> 15:00.080
<b>He's all yours.</b>

15:00.830 --> 15:02.710
<b>Would you like cake?</b>

15:03.700 --> 15:05.080
<b>I'll have some!</b>

15:05.380 --> 15:07.170
<b>Kakeru, how about you guys?</b>

15:07.170 --> 15:09.860
<b>Sorry, we're going for a walk.</b>

15:10.950 --> 15:12.890
<b>I'm starting by 5:30.</b>

15:12.890 --> 15:13.600
<b>Okay.</b>

15:17.660 --> 15:19.680
<b>Are you sure you want to run with me?</b>

15:20.260 --> 15:22.010
<b>No one said that.</b>

15:22.310 --> 15:24.190
<b>I just got into a habit of running.</b>

15:41.470 --> 15:42.330
<b>Here you go.</b>

15:45.340 --> 15:46.130
<b>It's really good!</b>

15:46.910 --> 15:49.040
<b>These are Chinese onions, tomatoes,</b>

15:49.040 --> 15:50.870
<b>and boiled spinach.</b>

15:50.870 --> 15:53.780
<b>Deep-fried vegetables and fried eggs.</b>

15:55.420 --> 15:56.890
<b>Sorry, chopsticks.</b>

15:57.500 --> 15:58.150
<b>Here.</b>

15:58.150 --> 15:59.210
<b>Thanks.</b>

16:03.560 --> 16:04.570
<b>The other day,</b>

16:06.270 --> 16:07.400
<b>at Kirinkan...</b>

16:07.400 --> 16:09.580
<b>Yeah, what about it?</b>

16:10.780 --> 16:12.490
<b>There was something I couldn't say.</b>

16:15.940 --> 16:16.740
<b>Sorry.</b>

16:22.180 --> 16:25.780
<b>I did something awful, and 
I got you wound up in it.</b>

16:26.940 --> 16:27.790
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

16:32.450 --> 16:33.140
<b>Sure,</b>

16:34.580 --> 16:36.080
<b>this hike, too.</b>

16:37.160 --> 16:38.580
<b>"For tomorrow."</b>

16:41.540 --> 16:42.820
<b>It is, isn't it?</b>

16:48.070 --> 16:51.230
<b>I've always been seeing shiny things,</b>

16:51.230 --> 16:54.700
<b>partly because of my dad's 
job as a glassblower.</b>

16:55.440 --> 16:58.700
<b>I don't know what they are again.</b>

16:59.100 --> 17:01.850
<b>I wonder when I started seeing them.</b>

17:04.710 --> 17:06.230
<b>Can I see that for a second?</b>

17:06.810 --> 17:07.710
<b>Sure.</b>

17:14.180 --> 17:16.320
<b>Our experiment's about to begin.</b>

17:17.000 --> 17:18.860
<b>I hope we learn something.</b>

17:18.860 --> 17:20.830
<b>Yeah, but</b>

17:21.190 --> 17:23.190
<b>maybe we don't have to.</b>

17:24.770 --> 17:26.940
<b>I never thought our families would</b>

17:26.940 --> 17:29.080
<b>get together to listen 
to my mom play piano.</b>

17:29.630 --> 17:31.660
<b>But maybe</b>

17:32.140 --> 17:34.340
<b>that's enough.</b>

17:34.790 --> 17:36.890
<b>Kakeru-kun, are you—</b>

17:37.190 --> 17:37.840
<b>Yeah,</b>

17:38.790 --> 17:40.350
<b>I think I'm afraid.</b>

18:09.080 --> 18:10.960
<b>Can you see it too, Kakeru-kun?</b>

18:10.960 --> 18:11.710
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:35.420 --> 18:38.560
<b>Your knees get so messed
up on the way down.</b>

18:46.820 --> 18:48.770
<b>Can you hear my voice?</b>

18:49.700 --> 18:51.660
<b>Yeah, I can.</b>

18:53.060 --> 18:55.720
<b>The other person is nearby, 
but you can't see her.</b>

18:56.060 --> 18:57.460
<b>Isn't that weird?</b>

18:58.690 --> 19:01.020
<b>Can you see me?</b>

19:02.030 --> 19:04.380
<b>I can't see too well yet.</b>

19:14.920 --> 19:15.750
<b>What's wrong?</b>

19:16.730 --> 19:20.330
<b>I think I might be afraid to be with you.</b>

19:21.360 --> 19:23.870
<b>Mom's asking me if I want to</b>

19:23.870 --> 19:26.760
<b>go on tour with her around the world.</b>

19:27.280 --> 19:29.530
<b>Kakeru-kun, what are you talking about?</b>

19:29.530 --> 19:33.060
<b>Are you saying you might leave soon?</b>

19:34.110 --> 19:37.010
<b>I think I've had enough of experiencing</b>

19:37.010 --> 19:39.820
<b>the sudden, expected loneliness.</b>

19:42.850 --> 19:46.030
<b>But we were together all day yesterday.</b>

19:50.520 --> 19:51.220
<b>I'm home.</b>

19:52.070 --> 19:55.700
<b>Onee-chan, come on! We're starting.</b>

19:59.360 --> 20:01.970
<b>Have a seat over there.</b>

20:06.400 --> 20:09.020
<b>If that's really a fragment of the future,</b>

20:10.150 --> 20:13.480
<b>it means we'll see the fireworks 
together next year, right?</b>

20:41.870 --> 20:44.770
<b>Once we're down the mountain, 
I want to go to Kazemichi.</b>

20:44.770 --> 20:45.720
<b>Sure thing.</b>

20:56.060 --> 20:57.060
<b>What's wrong?</b>

20:58.220 --> 21:01.300
<b>I need to talk to Touko again.</b>

21:05.490 --> 21:08.120
<b>It's been a while. How about 
we go to Kazemichi later?</b>

21:08.490 --> 21:09.260
<b>Yeah.</b>

23:30.700 --> 23:32.790
<b>Just hurry up and introduce yourselves.</b>

23:32.790 --> 23:33.840
<b>I'm Hiro Shirosaki.</b>

23:33.840 --> 23:34.770
<b>Yanagi Takayama.</b>

23:34.770 --> 23:36.040
<b>I'm Yukinari Imi.</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:37.800
<b>I'm Sachi Nagamiya.</b>

23:37.800 --> 23:39.850
<b>Um, you can see me?</b>

23:38.060 --> 23:39.850
<b>Episode 12
"Fireworks (Once Again)"</b>
